* A call through r68L (a macro using \Ln) with an empty argument (MSG ,Ok): as's NARG leaves the
* empty one out, so r68L called the macro with one argument less, \2 lost (Msg for MsgOk); the
* count is set before the call as r68 counts it (r68__Ln).
* fixed: 898d118 2026-10-11 r68togas: r68L with empty arguments
* expect text: 41fa0002 00014e71
MSG macro
 ifgt \L1
 nop
 endc
 lea Msg\2(pc),a0
 endm
 psect lmacro_empty,0,0,0,0,0
 MSG ,Ok
MsgOk dc.w 1
 ends
